sequenceDiagram
    participant D as Device or script
    participant A as EdgePulse API
    participant O as Operator (dashboard)

    D->>A: POST /devices/{id}/telemetry (vibration 6.4 mm/s)
    A->>A: Store reading, set device online
    A->>A: Vibration above 5.0 mm/s: raise critical alert
    A-->>D: 201 Created (reading)
    O->>A: GET /alerts?state=open
    A-->>O: 200 OK (includes the new critical alert)
    O->>A: POST /alerts/{id}/acknowledge
    A-->>O: 200 OK (state = acknowledged)
